WEBVTT

NOTE Machine translated from English captions; target=zu.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.718
Le vidiyo ikhombisa indlela yokuhlola i-neurovision kanye nokukhipha izibuko.

2
00:00:04.718 --> 00:00:08.020
Geza izandla ungachami.

3
00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:12.737
Uzodinga ishadi le-neurovision, ipeni namanothi omtholampilo, ububanzi

4
00:00:12.737 --> 00:00:17.455
wezibuko zokufunda kanye nentambo ubude obungu-40cm.

5
00:00:17.455 --> 00:00:21.700
Chaza ukuthi uzokwenzani ukuze uthole imvume.

6
00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:25.475
Hlalisa isiguli ngokunethezeka endaweni ekhanyiswe kahle.

7
00:00:25.475 --> 00:00:32.551
Sebenzisa intambo ukuze uqiniseke ukuthi ishadi ligcinwe ebangeni elifanele elingu-40cm.

8
00:00:32.551 --> 00:00:37.740
Bacele ukuthi bafunde phansi ishadi ngamehlo womabili ndawonye.

9
00:00:37.740 --> 00:00:42.500
Qopha umugqa omncane abangawufunda ngokukhululeka.

10
00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:49.220
Uma bengakwazi ukufunda ulayini we-N8, bese uzama ngezingilazi eziyi-1.5 diopter sphere.

11
00:00:49.220 --> 00:00:53.376
Uma besakwazi ukufunda i-N8, sebenzisa amandla aphezulu alandelayo, kanjalo

12
00:00:53.376 --> 00:00:54.860
baqhubeke, baze bakwazi ukukhululeka

13
00:00:54.860 --> 00:00:57.540
funda umbhalo we-N8.

14
00:00:57.540 --> 00:01:00.660
Qinisekisa ukuthi ingilazi i-fiddle-k futhi isiguli sijabule ngokubukeka kwabo.
